<title>USA: Ambac qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>Ambac qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Inc on Wednesday said that it qualified for bond insurance following three municipal bond issues, which are scheduled to be sold competitively:</p>
<p>--St Johns, Mich., $2.5 million Water and Sewer, direct purchase.</p>
<p>--Harrison County School District, Miss., $23 million General Obligations.</p>
<p>--Knox County, Tenn., $70 million GOs Public Improvement.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650)).</p>
